<title>USA: Halsey Drug names William Skelly chairman.</title>
<headline>Halsey Drug names William Skelly chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halsey Drug Co Inc said on Friday that William Skelly has been elected chairman of its board of directors.</p>
<p>Skelly joins the firm after serving as chairman, president and chief executive of Central Biomedia Inc.</p>
<p>Halsey, which has just completed a year-long restructuring, declined to say Skelly replaces.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
